[
    {
        "content": "<p>The Hasse diagram (SimpleGraph.hasse) of a partial order is triangle-free. This follows from not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt in Order.Cover, but the graph-theoretic statement (hasse α).CliqueFree 3 isn't in Mathlib. Would a PR adding this to Combinatorics.SimpleGraph.Hasse be welcome? Small diff, no new definitions.</p>",
        "id": 581276292,
        "sender_full_name": "Juan Pablo Silva Alvarado",
        "timestamp": 1774328094
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib/wiki/Code-in-backticks\">#backticks</a><br>\nAlso if you prefix identifiers with <code>docs#</code> it creates a link to them to see them easily, e.g. <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt#doc\">docs#not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</a></p>",
        "id": 581278927,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1774330016
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Why partial order and not preorder? The statement you referenced is about preorders</p>",
        "id": 581278970,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1774330036
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"933054\">@Snir Broshi</span>  You're right. <code>not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</code><br>\n  works for preorders, so the statement generalizes. Here's<br>\n  what I have:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/-- The Hasse diagram of a preorder is triangle-free. This</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  is the graph-theoretic formulation of</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  `not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt`: if `a ⋖ b` and `b ⋖ c` then `¬a ⋖</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  c`. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hasse_cliqueFree_three</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hasse</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CliqueFree</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">classical</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">hc</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hcard</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hab</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hac</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hbc</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span><span class=\"o\">⟩</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Finset.card_eq_three.mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hcard</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hasse_adj.mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hab</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hasse_adj.mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hbc</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hasse_adj.mp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hac</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rcases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rcases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rcases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">absurd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lt_asymm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt.trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">absurd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lt_asymm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt.trans</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h2.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h1.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h3</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I did open a pull request.</p>",
        "id": 581288686,
        "sender_full_name": "Juan Pablo Silva Alvarado",
        "timestamp": 1774335582
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Again I recommend you read <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib/wiki/Code-in-backticks\">#backticks</a>; compare not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt with <code>not_covBy_of_lt_of_lt</code></p>",
        "id": 581290881,
